# An audit's findings file is a map of a live system's weaknesses, and the
# rendered report is the same map with the fixes spelled out. Never let one
# ride along in a commit - keep them wherever the owner keeps documents.
findings*.json
findings*.json.bak
*-audit.json
*-audit.json.bak
*.html

# The schema example carries no real system's state.
!**/findings.example.json

# Byte-compiled generator scripts.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
